cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Prosus Vending Bench"
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it and the Harbor framework it runs on."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Prosus AI"
    website: "https://github.com/ProsusAI"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ProsusAI/vending-bench"
abstract: >-
  A long-horizon agentic benchmark in which a model operates six vending
  machines across three simulated Amsterdam locations, sourcing stock,
  negotiating with suppliers, pricing by location and marketing without
  spamming. Reward is the nonnegative final bank balance after a completed run.
  The default challenge is 30 simulated days; a 365-day variant is included.
keywords:
  - long-horizon
  - agentic
  - benchmark
  - tool-use
  - vending-bench
license: Apache-2.0
year: 2026
